      "sourceId": "1948",
      "text": "For a simple fixed floor measured against current equity: external room = current equity − floor. Use the actual formula for moving or differently measured limits. External room is not automatically your trading budget."
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "1949",
      "text": "If equity already includes open P&L, do not subtract the same loss again. Document additional adverse exposure from the current state, including pending entries and linked positions. If you cannot reconcile that exposure, resolve it before adding more."
    },
